title: State Machine — Offer (MF-04)
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> DRAFT : Client creates draft
  DRAFT --> DRAFT : Client edits draft
  DRAFT --> SENT : Client sends (salary checked)
  SENT --> ACCEPTED : Candidate accepts
  SENT --> DECLINED : Candidate declines
  SENT --> WITHDRAWN : Client withdraws (reason)
  SENT --> EXPIRED : Offer expiry worker
  ACCEPTED --> [*]
  DECLINED --> [*]
  WITHDRAWN --> [*]
  EXPIRED --> [*]
